{"id":"NCT07496567","title":"A Clinical Trial of EYE201/MK-8748 in People With Macular Degeneration (MK-8748-003)","official":"A Randomized Double-masked, Multicenter, 3-arm, Pivotal Phase 2/3 Study to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Intravitreal (IVT) EYE201/MK-8748 Compared to Aflibercept (2 mg) in Participants With Neovascular Age-related Macular Degeneration (NVAMD)","summary":"Researchers are looking for new ways to treat neovascular age-related macular degeneration (NVAMD).\n\nAvailable standard (usual) treatments for NVAMD, such as aflibercept, may not work for every person. Researchers want to learn if a trial medicine called tiespectus (also called MK-8748 or EYE201) can treat NVAMD.\n\nThe goal of this trial is to learn if tiespectus works as well as aflibercept to treat NVAMD.","conditions":["Macular Degeneration","Age-Related Macular Degeneration","Choroidal Neovascularization","Wet Macular Degeneration"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"Tiespectus"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Aflibercept"}],"criteria":"The main inclusion criteria include but are not limited to the following:\n\n* Has treatment naive choroidal neovascularization (CNV) secondary to age-related macular degeneration (AMD) including subfoveal, juxtafoveal and extrafoveal lesions or retinal angiomatous proliferations (RAP) and polypoidal choroidal vascularization (PCV) lesions in at least one eye (study eye)\n* The diagnosis of neovascular age-related macular degeneration (NVAMD) must have been made within 21 days prior to starting study treatment\n\nThe main exclusion criteria include but are not limited to the following\n\n* Has uncontrolled blood pressure at screening\n* History of any prior macular laser photocoagulation in the study eye\n* History of uveitis in either eye\n* History of cataract surgery, minimally invasive glaucoma surgery, or Yttrium-Aluminium Garnet (Yag) laser capsulotomy in the study eye within 90 days before entering the study\n* Has uncontrolled glaucoma in the study eye\n* Active retinal disease other than the condition under investigation in the study eye\n* Has previously received anti- vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF) therapy or other intravitreal (IVT) therapy in the study eye","minAge":"50 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":960,"start":"2026-04-15","pcd":"2028-07-31","upd":"2026-08-06","sponsor":"EyeBiotech Ltd.","areas":["other"],"central":["Toll Free Number · 1-888-577-8839 · Trialsites@msd.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Associated Retina Consultants - Gilbert","city":"Gilbert","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85259","s":"R","lat":33.3528,"lon":-111.789,"c":"Study Coordinator · 602-242-4928"},{"f":"The Retina Partners","city":"Encino","pr":"California","zip":"91436","s":"R","lat":34.1592,"lon":-118.5012,"c":"Jesus Vargas · 818-788-9333 ext. 1141 · jesusv@theretinapartners.com"},{"f":"Northern California Retina Vitreous Associates Medical Group, Inc.","city":"Mountain View","pr":"California","zip":"94040","s":"R","lat":37.386,"lon":-122.0838,"c":"Study Coordinator · 650-963-3465"},{"f":"Orange County Retina Medical Group","city":"Santa Ana","pr":"California","zip":"92705","s":"R","lat":33.7456,"lon":-117.8678,"c":"Study Coordinator · 714-972-8432"},{"f":"Retina Consultants of Southern Colorado","city":"Colorado Springs","pr":"Colorado","zip":"80909","s":"R","lat":38.8339,"lon":-104.8214,"c":"Study Coordinator · 719-473-9595"},{"f":"RSC Research LLC","city":"Denver","pr":"Colorado","zip":"80222","s":"R","lat":39.7392,"lon":-104.9847,"c":"Study Coordinator · 720-443-2425"},{"f":"Retina Consultants of Southern Colorado","city":"Pueblo","pr":"Colorado","zip":"81008","s":"R","lat":38.2544,"lon":-104.6091,"c":"Study Coordinator · 719-473-9595"},{"f":"Connecticut Eye Consultants, P.C.","city":"Danbury","pr":"Connecticut","zip":"06810","s":"R","lat":41.3948,"lon":-73.454,"c":"Study Coordinator · 203-791-2020"},{"f":"Retina Consultants, P.C.","city":"Manchest